{"type":"message","id":"2bcc3251","parentId":"4e9a5b0c","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:43:53.417Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Thursday, March 12th, 2026 — 8:43 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773319433416}}
{"type":"message","id":"9f03e502","parentId":"2bcc3251","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:44:02.815Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to execute an automatic evolution task via cron. Let me break down what needs to be done:\n\n1. Search ClawHub for the latest efficient skills with keywords: calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n2. Filter skills with downloads > 100 and updated within 6 months\n3. Install valuable skills\n4. Generate a short report and save to memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\nCurrent time is Thursday, March 12th, 2026 at 8:43 PM (Asia/Shanghai).\n\nFirst, I should check if there's a skill for ClawHub that I should use. Looking at the available skills:\n- \"clawhub\" - Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com\n\nThis is exactly what I need! Let me read the SKILL.md first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll execute the automatic evolution task now. Let me start by reading the ClawHub skill to properly search and install skills."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_27660f592ea046b58280b9d8","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":240,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15697,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.000768,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0135114}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773319433417}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6aa422c","parentId":"9f03e502","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:44:02.821Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_27660f592ea046b58280b9d8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773319442819}}
