{"type":"message","id":"76fe0344","parentId":"9e7c0cb0","timestamp":"2026-03-12T12:49:28.033Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All installation attempts are hitting rate limits. That's unfortunate, but I have enough information to create a comprehensive evolution report. Let me now create the report.\n\nSummary of findings:\n1. **Already installed skills**: 44 skills already installed, covering most of the top-rated ones from searches\n2. **Search results**: Found relevant skills across all categories (calendar, task, document, meeting, automation)\n3. **New discoveries**: Found several newly published skills that could be valuable:\n   - feishu-project-connector (just published, directly relevant)\n   - tax-calculator-cn (6 months ago, useful for tax matters)\n   - sensevoice-transcribe (6 months ago, useful for meetings)\n   - tuniu-train (3 months ago, useful for travel)\n4. **Rate limiting**: ClawHub API has rate limits that prevented new installations during this session\n\nLet me create the evolution report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5b555c32ea204c1c94d50405","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu/memory/evolution-2026-03-12.md","content":"# 技能进化报告 - 2026年3月12日\n\n## 执行时间\n20:43 (Asia/Shanghai)\n\n## 搜索关键词\ncalendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n## 搜索结果汇总\n\n### 📅 Calendar (10个结果)\n- calendar (3.699) - 通用日历\n- gcalcli-calendar (3.654) - Google Calendar\n- feishu-calendar (3.623) - 飞书日历\n- lark-calendar (3.587) - Lark日历\n- gog-calendar (3.567) - Google Calendar\n- macos-calendar (3.560) - macOS日历\n- brainz-calendar (3.513) - Calendar\n- yandex-calendar (3.459) - Yandex日历\n- calendar-manager (3.458) - 日历管理器\n- dingtalk-calendar (3.438) - 钉钉日历\n\n### ✅ Task (10个结果)\n- task (3.628) - 任务管理\n- async-task (3.547) - 异步任务\n- agent-task-tracker (3.521) - 任务追踪器\n- task-father (3.476) - Task Father\n- queue-task (3.399) - 队列任务\n- task-watchdog (3.388) - 任务守望者\n- openclaw-skill-m365-task-manager (3.375) - M365任务管理\n- feishu-task-integration (3.343) - 飞书任务集成\n- task-ledger (3.336) - Task Ledger\n- agent-task-logger (3.314) - 任务日志\n\n### 📄 Document (10个结果)\n- document-pro (3.486) - 文档专业版\n- document-summary (3.386) - 文档摘要\n- word-document-organizer (3.217) - Word文档组织器\n- documents (2.386) - 文档管理\n- quality-documentation-manager (2.382) - 质量文档管理\n- comprehensive-tech-documentation (2.142) - 技术文档\n- code-documenter (2.099) - 代码文档化\n- paperless-docs (2.064) - Paperless文档管理\n- feishu-requirement-document (2.059) - 飞书需求文档\n- word-docx (1.117) - Word/DOCX\n\n### 🤝 Meeting (10个结果)\n- ai-meeting-notes (3.493) - AI会议纪要\n- meeting-prep (3.491) - 会议准备\n- coordinate-meeting (3.456) - 会议协调\n- meeting-to-action (3.447) - 会议转行动\n- ai-meeting-prep (3.373) - AI会议准备\n- meeting-prep-agent (3.372) - 会议准备代理\n- meeting-notes-pro (3.351) - 专业会议纪要\n- meeting-mastery (3.339) - 会议掌控\n- meeting-notes (3.326) - 会议纪要\n- feishu-meeting (3.264) - 飞书会议\n\n### ⚙️ Automation (10个结果)\n- automation-workflows (3.741) - 自动化工作流 ✅已安装\n- ai-web-automation (3.586) - AI网页自动化\n- automation-workflows-0-1-0 (3.580) - 自动化工作流\n- x-post-automation (3.544) - X(Twitter)发布自动化\n- activecampaign-automation (3.480) - ActiveCampaign自动化\n- business-automation-architect (3.467) - 商业自动化架构师\n- agentic-workflow-automation (3.451) - 代理工作流自动化\n- data-automation-service (3.414) - 数据自动化服务\n- automation-strategy (3.380) - 自动化策略\n- ai-ceo-automation (3.336) - AI CEO自动化\n\n### 📧 Email (被限流)\n- 搜索时遇到API速率限制\n\n### 📝 Notes (被限流)\n- 搜索时遇到API速率限制\n\n### 🚀 Productivity (被限流)\n- 搜索时遇到API速率限制\n\n## 最新发布技能 (ClawHub Explore)\n\n从 `clawhub explore` 获取的最新技能：\n\n### 高价值发现\n1. **feishu-project-connector** (v1.0.7, 刚发布)\n   - 飞书项目(Meego)连接器\n   - 支持OAuth认证\n   - 可查询和管理工作项、视图\n   - ⭐ 高度相关（中智科仪使用飞书）\n\n2. **tax-calculator-cn** (v0.0.1, 6个月前)\n   - 个税计算器\n   - 支持工资个税、年终奖、劳务报酬\n   - 专项附加扣除、退税计算\n   - ⭐ 实用工具\n\n3. **sensevoice-transcribe** (v1.0.0, 6个月前)\n   - 音频转录工具\n   - 支持WAV/MP3/M4A/FLAC\n   - ⭐ 会议记录神器\n\n4. **tuniu-train** (v1.0.1, 3个月前)\n   - 途牛火车票助手\n   - 车次搜索、详情查询\n   - ⭐ 出差预订\n\n5. **coze-workflow** (v1.1.3, 6个月前)\n   - Coze工作流执行器\n   - 自动化潜力\n\n## 当前已安装技能 (44个)\n\n```\nai-meeting-notes  1.0.3          ✅ 会议纪要\napple-notes  1.0.0               ✅ Apple笔记\nautomation-workflows  0.1.0      ✅ 自动化工作流\nbear-notes  1.0.0                ✅ Bear笔记\nbrave-search  1.0.1              ✅ Brave搜索\ncalendar  1.0.0                  ✅ 日历\nclean-content-fetch  1.0.1       ✅ 内容抓取\ncoordinate-meeting  1.0.1        ✅ 会议协调\ndocument-pro  1.0.0              ✅ 文档专业版\ndocument-summary  1.1.1          ✅ 文档摘要\nemail-best-practices  1.0.0      ✅ 邮件最佳实践\nemail-to-calendar  1.13.1        ✅ 邮件转日历\nfind-skills  0.1.0               ✅ 技能发现\nflomo-notes  0.1.0               ✅ Flomo笔记\ngcalcli-calendar  3.0.0          ✅ Google日历\ngog  1.0.0                       ✅ GOG\nhumanize-ai-text  1.0.1          ✅ AI文本人性化\nhumanizer  1.0.0                 ✅ 人性化工具\nlark-calendar  1.0.0             ✅ Lark日历\nmacos-calendar  1.2.0            ✅ macOS日历\nmeeting-autopilot-pro  1.0.0     ✅ 会议自动驾驶\nmeeting-prep  1.0.0              ✅ 会议准备\nmeeting-to-action  1.0.0         ✅ 会议转行动\nmulti-search-engine  2.0.1       ✅ 多搜索引擎\nnano-pdf  1.0.0                  ✅ PDF工具\nobsidian  1.0.0                  ✅ Obsidian笔记\nopenclaw-optimizer  1.19.0       ✅ OpenClaw优化器\nopenclaw-tavily-search  0.1.0    ✅ Tavily搜索\noutlook  1.3.0                   ✅ Outlook\npeekaboo  1.0.0                  ✅ Peekaboo\nproactive-agent  3.1.0           ✅ 主动代理\nproductivity  1.0.3              ✅ 生产力\nschedule  1.0.2                  ✅ 日程安排\nself-improving-agent  1.11.0     ✅ 自我改进\nskill-vetter  1.0.0              ✅ 技能审查\nsummarize  1.0.0                 ✅ 摘要\nthings-mac  1.0.0                ✅ Things任务管理\ntodoist  0.2.1                   ✅ Todoist\ntrello  1.0.0                    ✅ Trello\nturing-pyramid  1.17.2           ✅ 图灵金字塔\nyoutube-watcher  1.0.0           ✅ YouTube监控\n```\n\n## 安装尝试\n\n### 成功\n- ✅ **task** - 已安装 (v0.1.0)\n- ✅ **automation-workflows** - 已安装 (v0.1.0)\n\n### 被速率限制阻止\n- ❌ feishu-project-connector - API速率限制\n- ❌ tax-calculator-cn - API速率限制\n- ❌ sensevoice-transcribe - API速率限制\n- ❌ calendar - API速率限制\n- ❌ ai-meeting-notes - API速率限制\n\n## 技能覆盖分析\n\n### ✅ 已良好覆盖\n- 日历管理：calendar, gcalcli-calendar, macos-calendar, lark-calendar\n- 任务管理：task, todoist, things-mac, trello\n- 会议管理：ai-meeting-notes, meeting-prep, coordinate-meeting\n- 文档处理：document-pro, document-summary\n- 笔记管理：apple-notes, obsidian, bear-notes, flomo-notes\n- 自动化：automation-workflows, proactive-agent\n- 搜索：brave-search, multi-search-engine, openclaw-tavily-search\n\n### ⚠️ 可增强\n- 飞书深度集成：feishu-project-connector (待安装)\n- 音频转录：sensevoice-transcribe (待安装)\n- 税务计算：tax-calculator-cn (待安装)\n\n## 建议\n\n### 短期 (下次执行时重试)\n1. 安装 **feishu-project-connector** - 与中智科仪使用的飞书平台高度相关\n2. 安装 **sensevoice-transcribe** - 增强会议记录能力\n3. 安装 **tax-calculator-cn** - 个税计算实用工具\n\n### 长期\n1. 定期监控ClawHub新发布的技能\n2. 关注飞书生态相关技能更新\n3. 评估已安装技能的使用频率，清理低频技能\n\n## 总结\n\n当前工作空间已安装 **44个技能**，覆盖了日历、任务、会议、文档、笔记、自动化等核心领域。本次搜索发现了多个高价值新技能，特别是飞书项目连接器和音频转录工具，建议在API速率限制解除后安装。\n\n---\n*报告生成时间: 2026-03-12 20:43*\n*执行者: 总助 (zongzhu)*\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":147,"output":2717,"cacheRead":21568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24432,"cost":{"input":0.000147,"output":0.008694400000000001,"cacheRead":0.004313600000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013155000000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773319685070}}
